{"id":"H3506","lemma":"יִתְרָן","transliteration":"yitran","sayIt":"yit-ran","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ithran","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.26;\nson of: Dishon (H1787);\nbrother of: Hemdan (H2533), Eshban (H0790) and Cheran (H3763)\n§ Ithran = \"advantage\"\n1) an Edomite, son of Dishon, a Horite, and probably a phylarch of a tribe of the Horim\n2) an descendant of Asher","glosses":["ithran"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ithran","kjv":"and Ithran"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ithran","kjv":"and Ithran"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ithran","kjv":"and Ithran"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:26","note":"These are the children of Dishon: Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:41","note":"The son of Anah: Dishon. The sons of Dishon: Hamran, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3500","lemma":"יֶ֫תֶר","transliteration":"yeter","gloss":"Jether"},{"id":"H0690","lemma":"אֲרָא","transliteration":"ara","gloss":"Ara"},{"id":"H0790","lemma":"אֶשְׁבָּן","transliteration":"eshban","gloss":"Eshban"},{"id":"H0878","lemma":"בְּאֵרָא","transliteration":"beera","gloss":"Beera"},{"id":"H1221","lemma":"בֶּ֫צֶר","transliteration":"betser","gloss":"Bezer"},{"id":"H1275","lemma":"בֵּרִי","transliteration":"beri","gloss":"Beri"},{"id":"H1787","lemma":"דִּישֹׁן","transliteration":"dishon","gloss":"Dishon"},{"id":"H1936","lemma":"הוֹד","transliteration":"hod","gloss":"Hod"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3506H","gloss":"Ithran","relation":"H3506H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}